Bind Npc 24407 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14407 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 641 "Research Result"
    Journal for karus "You must report to [Advisor] Herga."
    Journal for elmorad "You must report to [Advisor] Nez."
    Collect 1 of 900192000

Requires player level >= 64 and quest 640 is completed

Rewards
    Give 125000 experience
    Give 10000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Wow, you've finished it nicely! Hurry and take this research report to Herga, the[advisor] of Luperson Castle."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Hiya,'s you do the finishing neatly. This report the experimental results [[advisor] Dear Jimenez, come on, you want me to!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Is not <selfname>."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Brought [the] report experimental results from [the Chiefs Tobeoldae Vere?\n\nHerzegovina, the Luferson Castle province [advisor, you must pass the report experimental results."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "It's you, <selfname>."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Have you come with the [Research Report] from Grey, the [Subjugation Squad Chief]?\n\nAdvisor to the Nez El Morad Castle, you must pass the report experimental results."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "This friends ... Hit, but the joke came up to me, are you going to fool around?"
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Are you trying to play a joke on me now?"

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Hmm ... Hmm ... Yeah ... It looks like the end of the experiment. You can also create weapons Goblin basis for this guess Thank you, Chief."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Hmm ... Hmm ... I see ... I think the experiment is done well. I can create Couter-Goblin weapon from this. Well done. ."
